  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Colorful_Cal.PNG\" title=\"Colorful Cal the Coin King\"><img alt=\"Colorful Cal the Coin King\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"264\" src=\"/images/Colorful_Cal.PNG\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Colorful_Cal.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Colorful Cal the Coin King</div></div></div>\n<p>Colorful Cal is an giant <a href=\"/wiki/Felknight\" title=\"Felknight\">Divine Felknight</a> Champion found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> Level 5.  He is the object of the Quest <a href=\"/wiki/King's_Coin_Counterfeit_Conspiracy_Part_3\" title=\"King's Coin Counterfeit Conspiracy Part 3\">King's Coin Counterfeit Conspiracy Part 3</a> given by <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Ving_N'Seacressy\" title=\"Sir Ving N'Seacressy\">Sir Ving N'Seacressy</a>. He's surrounded by a small divine/shadow mob.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
